sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant E as WAF / API / BFF
  participant A as Account Information
  participant O as ODS Projection
  participant T as Transfer Overlay
  C->>E: GET account summary / history
  E->>A: Authenticated request
  A->>O: Read account-scoped projection
  O-->>A: Balances, history, freshness
  A->>T: Read recent CBS-confirmed writes
  T-->>A: Newer transfer snapshot, if any
  A-->>E: AccountInformationResponse
  E-->>C: Data with freshness and write capability

